---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
---

<Page
  title="Help and FAQ | Waymark"
  description="Answers to common questions about Waymark: devices, offline use, your progress, payments and refunds."
  heading="Help and FAQ"
>
  <dl class="faq">
    <dt>Do I need an account?</dt>
    <dd>No. Open the <a href="/app">study app</a> and start. Your progress is saved on the device you use.</dd>

    <dt>Can I use Waymark on my phone and my computer?</dt>
    <dd>
      Yes, in any modern browser. Progress is stored on each device separately for now. Android and iPhone apps are
      coming, and a purchase will unlock them too.
    </dd>

    <dt>I've bought Waymark. How do I use it on another device?</dt>
    <dd>
      After paying you get an unlock code (it looks like WM-XXXX-XXXX), also shown in Settings. On your other device,
      open the app, go to Settings, choose "Unlock or enter a code" and type it in. One purchase covers up to 3 of your
      own devices. Changed phone? Email <a href="mailto:support@waymarkprep.co.uk">support@waymarkprep.co.uk</a> with
      your code and we'll reset it.
    </dd>

    <dt>Does it work offline?</dt>
    <dd>Once the app has loaded, questions are stored on your device. A fuller offline mode comes with the phone apps.</dd>

    <dt>Are these the real test questions?</dt>
    <dd>
      No. Real test questions are not published. Our questions are original practice items written from the official
      handbook, and each names the chapter and section it comes from.
    </dd>

    <dt>How much does it cost?</dt>
    <dd>Chapters 1 and 2 and one mock exam are free. Full access will be £9.99, paid once, with no subscription. See <a href="/pricing">pricing</a>.</dd>

    <dt>How do refunds work?</dt>
    <dd>See <a href="/refunds">cancellation and refunds</a> and our <a href="/pass-promise">pass promise</a>.</dd>

    <dt>I think a question is wrong.</dt>
    <dd>
      Tap "Report a problem" under the question, or email <a href="mailto:support@waymarkprep.co.uk">support@waymarkprep.co.uk</a>.
      Fixes are listed in the <a href="/corrections">corrections log</a>.
    </dd>

    <dt>How do I reset my progress?</dt>
    <dd>In the app, go to Today, then Settings, then "Reset all progress".</dd>

    <dt>Can Waymark book my test?</dt>
    <dd>No. Tests are booked only through the official <a href="https://www.gov.uk/life-in-the-uk-test" rel="noopener">GOV.UK service</a>.</dd>

    <dt>Is Waymark accessible?</dt>
    <dd>We aim to meet WCAG 2.2 AA. See our <a href="/accessibility">accessibility statement</a>.</dd>
  </dl>

  <h2>Still need help?</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:support@waymarkprep.co.uk">support@waymarkprep.co.uk</a>. We aim to reply within two working days.</p>
</Page>
